# ReproAgent

Invoke this Skill explicitly with `$reproagent` or through `/skills`. Only an explicit
user request may start a paid ReproAgent run.

ReproAgent turns a Python bug description into a pytest regression, runs it on the
buggy version, verifies the evidence, repeats the failure independently and exports a
replayable package. It uses its own configured model; this Skill only invokes the
installed entry point and explains the recorded evidence.

